   <Row ss:AutoFitHeight="0" ss:Height="56.5">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="s62"><Data ss:Type="Number">8</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="s63"><Data ss:Type="String">Description, Objective of the scheme</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="s68"><Data ss:Type="String">The primary objective of the investment strategy is to generate capital appreciation through equity and equity related instruments and income through arbitrage, derivatives strategies, special situations and fixed income investments.  There is no assurance that the investment objective of the Investment strategy will be achieved.</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
