    <Cell ss:StyleID="s63"><Data ss:Type="String">Stated Asset Allocation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="s68"><Data ss:Type="String">Equity &amp; Equity related instruments (inlcuding REITs)- 25 to 75%&#10;Debt and money market instruments# - 25 to 75%&#10;Short exposure through unhedged derivative positions in equity and debt instruments - 0 to 25%&#10;Units issued by REITs and InvITs - 0 to 20%</Data></Cell>
